  (descr "J1 Cixi Kefa KF128-5.08-3P-AA fixed rising-clamp screw terminal 3P 5.08 mm, body on face B (back variant: drawn as seen through the board), pin 1 at the origin, pins 2/3 at x -5.08/-10.16, wire entry toward -y. Source: Cixi Kefa drawing KF128-5.08 rev A 2021-03-13 (LCSC C474953, https://datasheet.lcsc.com/datasheet/pdf/a267f2fbdc005306ff962adad87a9bbc.pdf), sheet 1/1: PCB layout d1.40 +0.10/0 at 5.08, hole row 5.40 from the rear body edge; side view depth 10.70 (so 5.30 from the hole row to the wire-entry face), height 14.10, pin 0.80 x 0.90, 4.30 long; front view body P x 5.08 = 15.24; top view interlock nubs 0.60 beyond one end (pin-1 end here, from the drawing's chirality). Drill 1.5 (inside the 1.40-1.50 hole tolerance), pad d3.0 chosen. Courtyard = body + nubs + 4.65 mm straight wire before the bend into the box (limited by the notch_l keep-out), 0.25 margin")
